---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover" />
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#0d0d12" />
  <title>Cuekeeper</title>
  <style>
    :root { color-scheme: dark; }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      margin: 0; background: #0d0d12; color: #f2f2f5;
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      min-height: 100dvh; padding: 20px 16px 48px;
    }
    main { max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto; }
    h1 { font-size: 1.4rem; margin: 0 0 4px; letter-spacing: .02em; }
    h2 { font-size: 1.05rem; margin: 18px 0 8px; }
    p.sub { color: #a7a7b3; margin: 0 0 18px; font-size: .95rem; }
    .hidden { display: none !important; }
    .card {
      background: #17171e; border: 1px solid #26262f; border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;
    }
    label { display: block; font-size: .85rem; color: #a7a7b3; margin: 10px 0 6px; }
    input[type="text"], input[type="number"] {
      width: 100%; background: #0d0d12; border: 1px solid #33333e; color: #f2f2f5;
      border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px; font-size: 1rem;
    }
    button {
      background: #7c5cff; color: #fff; border: 0; border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 14px 18px; font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer;
      width: 100%; margin-top: 12px;
    }
    button.ghost { background: #26262f; }
    button.plist { background: #1d1d26; text-align: left; margin-top: 8px; }
    code.uri {
      display: block; background: #0d0d12; border: 1px dashed #44444f;
      border-radius: 8px; padding: 10px; margin: 8px 0; word-break: break-all;
      font-size: .85rem; color: #c9b8ff;
    }
    .msg { min-height: 1.4em; color: #ffb3b3; font-size: .9rem; margin-top: 8px; }
    table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: .9rem; }
    th { text-align: left; color: #a7a7b3; font-weight: 600; font-size: .78rem;
         padding: 6px 4px; border-bottom: 1px solid #26262f; }
    td { padding: 8px 4px; border-bottom: 1px solid #1d1d26; vertical-align: middle; }
    td.n { color: #a7a7b3; width: 2em; }
    td input { padding: 8px; font-size: .95rem; }
    .dim { color: #a7a7b3; font-size: .82rem; }
    #now-title { font-size: 1.25rem; margin: 0; }
    #now-artist { color: #a7a7b3; margin: 2px 0 10px; }
    .pbar { height: 8px; background: #26262f; border-radius: 99px; overflow: hidden; }
    #progress { height: 100%; width: 0%; background: #7c5cff; border-radius: 99px;
                transition: width .9s linear; }
    #now-time { font-size: .82rem; color: #a7a7b3; margin-top: 6px; }
    #countdown { font-size: 1.05rem; margin: 12px 0 0; color: #ffd479; font-weight: 600; }
    .dot { display: inline-block; width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 99px;
           background: #51e08c; margin-right: 8px; }
    .dot.off { background: #55555f; }
    #log { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 12px 0 0; font-size: .85rem; }
    #log li { padding: 6px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #1d1d26; color: #cfcfda; }
    .hint { font-size: .85rem; color: #a7a7b3; }
    ol.hint { padding-left: 20px; }
    ol.hint li { margin: 6px 0; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
  <h1>✂️ Cuekeeper</h1>
  <p class="sub">Spotify pone la música y las transiciones; esta página pone los cortes.</p>

  <!-- 1 · conectar -->
  <section id="view-setup" class="hidden">
    <div class="card">
      <h2>1 · Conecta tu Spotify</h2>
      <p class="hint">Necesitas un <strong>Client ID</strong> (gratis, 2 minutos):</p>
      <ol class="hint">
        <li>Entra en <strong>developer.spotify.com/dashboard</strong> e inicia sesión.</li>
        <li>Create app → ponle el nombre que quieras.</li>
        <li>En <strong>Settings → Redirect URIs</strong> añade esta URL tal cual:</li>
      </ol>
      <code class="uri" id="redirect-uri">…</code>
      <p class="hint">Guarda los cambios y copia el <strong>Client ID</strong> aquí:</p>
      <label for="client-id">Client ID</label>
      <input type="text" id="client-id" value="fd94068b66c1414cb806b0afc15013b3" autocomplete="off" />
      <button id="btn-connect">Conectar con Spotify</button>
      <p class="msg" id="setup-msg"></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 2 · elegir playlist -->
  <section id="view-choose" class="hidden">
    <div class="card">
      <h2>2 · Elige la playlist</h2>
      <div id="playlist-list"></div>
      <p class="msg" id="choose-msg"></p>
      <button id="btn-logout" class="ghost">Desconectar</button>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 3 · fijar cortes -->
  <section id="view-cuts" class="hidden">
    <div class="card">
      <h2 id="cuts-title">3 · Cortes</h2>
      <p class="hint">Segundos donde <strong>empieza</strong> y donde <strong>termina</strong> cada tema.
      Vacío = se reproduce entero. Los 4 cortes de la noche vienen pre-rellenados.</p>
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>#</th><th>Tema</th><th>Empieza&nbsp;(s)</th><th>Termina&nbsp;(s)</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody id="cuts-body"></tbody>
      </table>
      <button id="btn-start">▶ Empezar la noche</button>
      <button id="btn-back" class="ghost">← otra playlist</button>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 4 · vigilando -->
  <section id="view-watch" class="hidden">
    <div class="card">
      <h2><span class="dot" id="live-dot"></span>Vigilando</h2>
      <p id="now-title">—</p>
      <p id="now-artist">esperando reproducción…</p>
      <div class="pbar"><div id="progress"></div></div>
      <p id="now-time"></p>
      <p id="countdown" class="hidden"></p>
      <p class="hint">Deja esta página abierta en primer plano y el móvil enchufado.
      Dale play a la playlist en Spotify con el Mix activado y olvídate.</p>
      <button id="btn-stop" class="ghost">⏹ Detener</button>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h2>Registro</h2>
      <ul id="log"></ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<script>
  import { boot } from '../lib/app';
  boot();
</script>
</body>
</html>
